WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.718
Tushpa, by Lake Van,
was the capital of Urartu.

2
00:00:05.758 --> 00:00:08.256
Its citadel crowned the Rock of Van.

3
00:00:08.496 --> 00:00:13.886
In 735 BC the Assyrian king
Tiglath-pileser III

4
00:00:13.926 --> 00:00:16.296
marched into the heart
of the kingdom.

5
00:00:16.336 --> 00:00:20.386
His inscriptions say he shut
King Sarduri II up in Tushpa

6
00:00:20.426 --> 00:00:23.388
and defeated him
before the city gates.

7
00:00:23.628 --> 00:00:26.338
Yet they do not claim
that the citadel fell,

8
00:00:26.378 --> 00:00:27.873
and it did not.

9
00:00:27.913 --> 00:00:30.342
Hold the royal road.

